  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mindoro Strait Sustainable and Equitable Tuna for Bankability (MS-SETB) Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Overall Objective: A fully sustainable sourcing and equitable seafood production leads to an enabled and strengthened ecology-based economies of the fisheries and aquaculture sector in the Philippines, thereby contributing to SDGs 1, 8, 12, and 14. Specific Objective: Sustainable fishing and resource-efficient processing practices in Occidental Mindoro allow for a more equitable participation in national and international seafood supply chains.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
